# Keep build contexts small and free of local data/secrets
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/venv
**/venv_native
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.log
backend/users_db.json*
backend/.dev_secret_key
backend/tests
backend/scripts
.vscode
